msgstr "Optional immutable wake target borrowed by an IRQ provider."

msgid ""
"notify runs in publisher context and must be bounded and legal in that IRQ. "
"Storage and context outlive all publishers. Stop and join publishers before "
"destroying the sink. A wake is only a hint; latched RX/request predicates "
"stay authoritative."
msgstr ""
"notify runs in publisher context and must be bounded and legal in that IRQ. "
"Storage and context outlive all publishers. Stop and join publishers before "
"destroying the sink. A wake is only a hint; latched RX/request predicates "
"stay authoritative."

msgid "Immutable CPU and kernel facts for cold wake binding."
msgstr "Immutable CPU and kernel facts for cold wake binding."

msgid ""
