msgid "watchdog.h"
msgstr "watchdog.h"

msgid "Irreversible IWDG effects and neutral hardware reset causes."
msgstr "Irreversible IWDG effects and neutral hardware reset causes."

msgid ""
"Enable IWDG and report its effect and known timing bounds; activation is "
"irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Enable IWDG and report its effect and known timing bounds; activation is "
"irreversible."

msgid ""
"Success establishes nominal hardware programming, not a guaranteed deadline."
" Both timeout bounds remain zero when oscillator limits are unknown. A "
"product requiring bounded timing must admit the oscillator profile before "
"activation. Enable runs in a privileged task and is serialized with feed, "
"state and platform stop. Install IRQ feeding only after this call returns; "
"activation does not support a concurrent reload during shadow-register "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"Success establishes nominal hardware programming, not a guaranteed deadline."
" Both timeout bounds remain zero when oscillator limits are unknown. A "
"product requiring bounded timing must admit the oscillator profile before "
"activation. Enable runs in a privileged task and is serialized with feed, "
"state and platform stop. Install IRQ feeding only after this call returns; "
"activation does not support a concurrent reload during shadow-register "
"programming."

msgid "[inout] Fixed provider; product owns feed/recovery policy."
msgstr "[inout] Fixed provider; product owns feed/recovery policy."

msgid "[in] Requested nominal timeout in maintained range."
msgstr "[in] Requested nominal timeout in maintained range."

msgid ""
"[in] Requested CPU-managed debug-freeze setting; external debugger "
