msgstr "No implicit acknowledgement, reboot or product classification."

msgid "Bitmask of NX_RESET_*; multiple causes may be reported."
msgstr "Bitmask of NX_RESET_*; multiple causes may be reported."

msgid "Hardware-selected timeout bounds, including declared LSI uncertainty."
msgstr "Hardware-selected timeout bounds, including declared LSI uncertainty."

msgid ""
"A zero minimum and maximum mean the timeout bounds are unknown, for example "
"while hardware shadow updates remain pending or no oscillator limits have "
"been reviewed. The enabled and irreversible facts remain valid. debug_freeze"
" reports the provider-supported firmware configuration. Providers with CPU-"
"readable debug control observe its setting. A provider without CPU debug-"
"control access supports false only; that value does not observe or describe "
"an external debugger's setting."
msgstr ""
"A zero minimum and maximum mean the timeout bounds are unknown, for example "
"while hardware shadow updates remain pending or no oscillator limits have "
"been reviewed. The enabled and irreversible facts remain valid. debug_freeze"
" reports the provider-supported firmware configuration. Providers with CPU-"
"readable debug control observe its setting. A provider without CPU debug-"
"control access supports false only; that value does not observe or describe "
"an external debugger's setting."
